\f0\b0 \
\

\f1\b Part 1: Detailed Agent Harness Module Specifications
\f0\b0 \
The following provides comprehensive details on each module in the Mechanistic agent harness, including deterministic vs. LLM-driven implementation, input/output specifications, and representative prompt excerpts from the base (pre-optimization) configuration. All modules operate within a structured state machine that maintains reaction context across execution phases.\
\

\f1\b Deterministic Modules
\f0\b0 \
\

\f1\b Check Atom Balance
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\ri0\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf0 Type: Deterministic | Phase: Pre-loop
